    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/4e78cf4e9bf60377b0937839297cb957.poster.avif?t=1741943280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/4e78cf4e9bf60377b0937839297cb957.webm?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/4e78cf4e9bf60377b0937839297cb957.mp4?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>HAZAMA QUEEN is a high-speed &amp; rogue light FPS.<br>Use your &quot;YAMI(japanese-complex-sickness) right hand&quot; to deliver powerful blows and your switchable left-hand weapon to conquer the demon-infested hell!<br>Keep on defeating enemies and sucking the &quot;YAMI&quot; or Mary will instantly be dead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/d7ea7bca07b9fc01049801731d1b0ad8.poster.avif?t=1741943280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/d7ea7bca07b9fc01049801731d1b0ad8.webm?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/d7ea7bca07b9fc01049801731d1b0ad8.mp4?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>The lever-action rifle is a Girl's Best Friend!<br>While reloading, fire a mighty blow with your right-hand, and keep the demons at bay with your incessant attacks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/737758b62ffe2bfbd68d234a9bcba895.poster.avif?t=1741943280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/737758b62ffe2bfbd68d234a9bcba895.webm?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/737758b62ffe2bfbd68d234a9bcba895.mp4?t=1741943280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>Grab the raw head of the &quot;Circle Crasher&quot;(Women who participate in all-male gatherings often appear in Japanese university clubs, destroying relationships) by the scruff of the neck and release the YAMI!<br>Can you master these weapons of habit?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>.<br>In the year 202X, the world is enveloped in &quot;YAMI&quot;!<br>Demons overflow onto the earth, and people are just waiting to be overrun and exterminated!<br>Then, one of the make-up girls, who is a JI-RAI-K(Google jiraikei girl!), decides to storm into hell and finish off the Demon King!<br><br>You become the cute &amp; serious &amp; cute &amp; crazy mine girl, Skewer Mary!<br>You must conquer hell to save the world from the &quot;sickness&quot;!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318810/extras/de899e18eb4103be7d3b2bfa87e0358a.avif?t=1741943280\" /></span>.<br>Mary the Skewer.<br>The 36th generation of &quot;YAMINCHU\u201d.<br>The 36th generation of &quot;YAMINCHU&quot; is a special group of warriors who deal with &quot;YAMI&quot;   passed down from generation to generation.<br>They have been fighting against demons who target people's &quot;YAMI&quot; in the shadows of history.<br><br>Mary is the most pop-YAMI person because she has been dealing with sickness in a natural way.<br>She has the highest tolerance for the YAMI of all generations.<br>In battle, she was cut down and her right hand was immediately thrust into the brain of a demon.<br>She is now known as &quot;Skewer Mary. By the way, she is 20 years old",
